{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"issues\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"screen\": \"我到底在气谁 又在想谁\",\n      \"source\": \"心里明明有东西，却还分不清这份不平静究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念——这是一种尚未找到对象、也尚未找到语言的失落。\",\n      \"type\": \"5\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿尚未分清情绪究竟是愤怒、遗憾还是怀念，也没有找到对象；屏幕稿却具体化成了对某个人的生气和想念，并添加了一句明确的内心追问。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"screen\": \"越往前赶，思绪越盘旋，始终停不下来\",\n      \"source\": \"不停地往前赶，只是为了避免停下来。思绪就这样反复盘旋，试图想清楚，却始终无法停歇。\",\n      \"type\": \"4\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿写的是赶着往前走以避免停下来，同时思绪反复盘旋；屏幕稿改成越赶思绪越盘旋，增加了两者之间的递进关系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"screen\": \"开头的试探又把问题递回来：我究竟要怎样继续生活\",\n      \"source\": \"也可以听成：如果把这次回返听成心理上的回望，开头的试探姿态仿佛把问题重新递回来：“那么，我究竟要怎样继续生活？”\",\n      \"type\": \"2\",\n      \"severity\": \"轻微\",\n      \"why\": \"定稿明确将其限定为一种可选的心理回望听法，并用“仿佛”保留不确定性；屏幕稿改成直接陈述，确定性有所增强。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f2919a19-65cd-419e-ba25-36f57638abb0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T213958510506Z", "elapsed_seconds": 270.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T21:44:28.781246+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7512dfa22ccf31dd49ffda31f155cee9da3294b94ff73fd2924c7e48757ae84d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-htt